WEBVTT

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.270
Hey there, everyone!

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:09.280
Hello.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:14.490
Today, we've left the broadcast room to 
bring you "Attacking the School's Hottest!"

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.740
from the classroom of Kokomi Shiina-san, 
a student who made waves a while back.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:24.840
Shiina-san, we're down to less than 
two weeks before the nationals.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:25.680
Yeah.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.270
I'm so nervous, it's like I'm competing myself.

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.750
It's so exciting.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:34.770
As you can tell, everyone from 
her class is pretty psyched, too.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:37.640
Being in the nationals is pretty amazing.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.650
Shiina-san, we're rooting for you.

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:42.040
Make sure you place!

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.220
Fight!

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.770
Try not to get hurt, but do your best.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:47.650
So, Shiina-san...

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:48.650
Hm?

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.980
Tell us your thoughts looking 
ahead to the tournament.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:55.020
Well, I'd like to make sure 
I don't make any mistakes

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.950
during my performance, and score high.

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Kokomi-chan is amazing!</i>

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.400
<i>You can do it, Kokomi-chan!</i>

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:07.960
<i>This has been Akane Sakurai, 
coming at you from Class 2-B!</i>

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:40.250
<b>On the Other Side of the Cream Soda</b>

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:05.970
Here you go, Shiina-senpai.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.290
Thank you.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.770
You didn't make any major mistakes.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:16.210
If you keep that up, I think 
you'll be able to score well.

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:18.090
Thank you.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:22.000
Also, about what we were discussing before...

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:22.680
Yes?

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:27.360
How about increasing the difficulty of the 
combos in the middle of your routine?

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:29.980
You're getting almost everything 
right during practice.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.850
I think you can do it, Shiina-san.

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:36.050
Yeah, but I can only get it 
right about 80% of the time.

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:38.780
I'm not sure if I want to try 
that during the tournament.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.950
But you <i>can</i> do it.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.780
I think it'd be a waste if you 
didn't at least give it a try.

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:47.160
Give it a try?

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:49.280
Now that you've come this far,

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.380
don't you want to try hard to place?

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:53.410
Yeah, but...

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:56.060
Everyone's afraid of making mistakes.

00:03:56.550 --> 00:04:01.510
But I get the feeling you're being a bit
 too cautious with your performances.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:02.810
Huh?

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:05.220
There's a deadline for your application,

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.360
so think it over,

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:08.550
and decide by the start of the week.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.380
Okay.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:18.810
<i>I think it'd be a waste if you 
didn't at least give it a try.</i>

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.980
<i>Give it a try, huh?</i>

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.420
There we go.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:27.450
Hm?

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:29.490
Kokomi-chan?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.680
<i>Everyone's afraid of making mistakes.</i>

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:37.880
<i>Maybe I started to fear making 
mistakes without even realizing it.</i>

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.630
Hey, Kokomi-chan!

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:45.150
<i>I get the feeling you're 
being a bit too cautious.</i>

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:48.140
<i>That means there's nothing interesting 
about my performances, doesn't it?</i>

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:50.350
Kokomi-chan.

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:54.540
S-Sasahara-senpai.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:57.130
You were practicing pretty late.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:58.240
You must be tired.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.830
N-Nah.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.280
Huh?

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.990
You're closed already?

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:04.300
Yeah,

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.820
my grandpa hurt his back, so...

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:08.990
His back?

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:10.870
He threw out his back.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.270
It happens all the time these days.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:17.760
When he stands up, he yells, "Ugh!" 
And then he can't move.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.840
That sounds painful.

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:22.630
What about you, Kokomi-chan? What's wrong?

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:25.330
I kept calling you and you didn't notice.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.260
Did you forget who I was?

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.350
S-Sorry.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:30.800
I was just kidding.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:35.280
I thought you might have been 
worried about something.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.270
You okay?

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:39.190
I was just thinking about something.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:40.790
I see...

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:43.320
It's almost time for the tournament, isn't it?

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.020
Yeah.

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:46.360
Oh, can I come and cheer you on?

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:49.320
Y-You don't have to, really!

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.490
I'll be looking forward to it.

00:05:57.810 --> 00:06:01.090
<i>Sasahara-senpai is always so wonderful.</i>

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:05.440
<i>I don't want to do something 
dumb while she's watching.</i>

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:10.410
<i>Maybe it'd be safer to just 
keep my routine the way it is.</i>

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:32.200
<b>Commentator: Nonoka Sasahara                              Announcer: Akane Sakurai</b>

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:32.860
And now it's time for the girl we've 
all been waiting for, Kokomi Shiina!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:38.980
<b>Matsuri Kagura               Emi Sagara               Marika Saeki</b>

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:41.910
<b>Judges</b>

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:41.910
<b>Marezou               Rino Suzukawa</b>

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:53.260
Uh-oh! That was an unfortunate error by Shiina!

00:06:59.230 --> 00:06:59.890
What?!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:05.650
Yikes! Another error for Shiina!

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:07.900
And now for her scores.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.000
Buzz.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:10.830
X.

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:12.620
Bzzz.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:13.870
Nope.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.390
Marezou-san, don't scare me like that.

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.640
<i>Everyone's afraid of making mistakes.</i>

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:45.810
I even had a dream about it.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:48.820
Maybe I'm worrying too much.

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:53.280
So, did you make this bread yourself, honey?

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.990
That's right.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:58.080
It's the first time I've tried it. How is it?

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.230
It's good.

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:00.950
Right, Kokomi?

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:05.360
<i>I think it'd be a waste if you 
didn't at least give it a try.</i>

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:06.920
Don't think about it,

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:07.880
don't think about it.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:09.510
Kokomi?

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:11.680
Thanks for breakfast.

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:13.130
You're done?

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:13.920
Yeah.

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:15.500
I have morning practice.

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:21.640
Did I say something wrong?

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:37.280
Her expression's so stiff...

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:39.540
Mochizuki-senpai...

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:42.560
Maybe it's because your competition is soon?

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:45.710
It's like you're being more cautious...

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.650
<i>I get the feeling you're 
being a bit too cautious.</i>

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.580
Erena-san?

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:55.690
Are you bugging Kokomi-san again?

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:59.250
You're sneaking around taking 
pictures like a shinobi.

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:04.370
I'm a lady, so you could at least call me a kunoichi.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:06.530
Oh, a kunoichi!

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:09.090
A female ninja! How cool!

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:10.690
Nin nin! Poof!

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.070
I'm not worrying about it.

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:14.900
Kokomi-chan?

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:18.410
No, it's nothing.

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:24.410
Wow!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.920
Okay, this is my first time trying this!

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.440
I'm going to juggle with six balls.

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.640
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:40.620
Oops...

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:44.680
I failed!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.810
And I only have a little while 
left before the big event...

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:53.110
<i>I only have a little while left 
before my tournament, too.</i>

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.230
Kokomi-chan!

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:55.120
Huh?

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:56.870
I messed up a little bit,

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:59.360
but where do you think I need to improve?

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:01.610
I wasn't really watching.

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:02.710
Sorry.

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:03.700
Okay.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:07.320
If you notice anything I can fix, tell me anytime.

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:08.350
Sure.

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:10.720
I need to practice a bit more.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:14.650
Kokomi-chan.

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:15.130
Huh?

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.320
What are you doing for lunch?

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:19.920
I'm going to buy some yakisoba bread.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.470
Want to come with me?

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:26.880
<i>I should eat a melon bun to cheer myself up.</i>

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:28.350
Sure.

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:36.340
You seemed kind of down.

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:37.480
Are you okay?

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:41.870
Oh, um... I think I'm just hungry.

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:44.080
You got two melon buns.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.920
You must have been starving.

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:48.370
Huh?

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.880
What's Sasahara-senpai doing?

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:55.790
Part-time jobs

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.220
Part-time jobs?

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:55.800
Hm?

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.600
That's right.

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:59.470
My grandpa can't move very well,

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:02.880
so we decided to look for someone 
who can help out on the weekends.

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:03.970
Can you hold these?

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.930
Give it here, Sasahara-senpai.

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:09.560
I'm a little worried,

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:12.710
but there are customers who 
look forward to visiting us,

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:15.760
so I was thinking of giving it a try myself.

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:17.530
Sounds like a lot of work.

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.530
Well, I'm sure it'll work out.

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:21.410
All done.

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:23.400
You're so great, Kokomi-chan!

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:24.880
It's up so straight and even.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:25.880
It's nothing.

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:29.690
I'm not very coordinated, 
so this helps me out a lot.

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.520
Maybe I'll give it a try.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:37.200
You wanna give it a try, too, Kokomi-chan?

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:37.750
Huh?

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:39.350
Really?

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:40.600
That'd be great!

00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:42.050
S-Saeki-san!

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:45.800
This is a good chance for you and 
Sasahara-senpai to get closer.

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:49.730
It'd be so much help if you both came!

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:54.700
<i>If I stayed home, I'd just be worrying 
about my rhythmic gymnastics.</i>

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:59.190
<i>Helping Sasahara-senpai might 
take my mind off things.</i>

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:03.170
Well, if you think I'd be able to help...

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:05.950
Thank you, Kokomi-chan!

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:09.040
Girl Friend BETA.

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:19.520
Michiru Tomura from Class 2-C.

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:21.440
I have a few part-time jobs already,

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:24.460
so just leave it all to me... 
Or something like that!

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:27.600
Marika Saeki from Class 2-B.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.470
Kokomi Shiina from the same class.

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:31.340
I know you.

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:33.000
You're the rhythmic gymnastics ace.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.000
The heroine of the school, right?

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.020
That's not...

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:40.440
I've always wanted to try 
cosplaying in a leotard.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.200
Cosplaying?

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:47.560
It'll be nice to work with you 
all today and tomorrow.

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:48.300
Right.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:51.960
Tomura-san, you have a lot 
of experience working,

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:54.290
so could you help me in the kitchen?

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:55.410
Roger!

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:56.920
Kokomi-chan and Marika-chan,

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.320
could I ask you to be waitresses?

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:00.340
Sure!

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:03.840
Two cream sodas, please.

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:05.300
Okay!

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.010
All right.

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:14.230
Thanks for waiting.

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.390
Th-This is...

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:18.670
Cream soda?

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:21.200
You had to phrase it like a question yourself?

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:23.150
I might have messed up a little bit.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:26.530
Wh-What did you mess up to get <i>that</i>?

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:28.990
I tried putting in a secret ingredient!

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:31.000
You don't need to put that in there!

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.820
It's not secret at all now!

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:34.060
I can't?

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.780
I'm going to make it again.

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:44.880
<i>Sasahara-senpai said she wasn't 
very coordinated, but...</i>

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.930
<i>I think it's more like she's...</i>

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:52.530
<i>extremely,</i>

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:53.430
<i>completely,</i>

00:13:53.980 --> 00:13:55.380
<i>totally,</i>

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:56.140
<i>entirely...</i>

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:02.110
<i>uncoordinated in every way.</i>

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:04.330
I'm sorry!

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:07.890
Senpai, why do you want to keep
 trying to do this stuff when you can't?

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:10.600
Because it's cool!

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:11.950
Don't you want to try it?

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:14.950
Yeah, but you're taking on too much.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:19.070
You don't know if you can do 
something unless you try.

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:22.360
<i>She looks like she's having a lot of fun.</i>

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:27.210
<i>I guess that's what it means to try 
things without being afraid of failing.</i>

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:30.400
Thank you.

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.260
Kokomi-chan, you forgot the change.

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:35.330
Huh?

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:36.990
Oh, no!

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:42.280
Excuse me!

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:50.110
I'm really, <i>really</i> sorry.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:53.580
You don't have to apologize that much.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:56.200
The customer wasn't really mad, either, right?

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.580
You worry too much, Shiina-san.

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:01.310
But, because I messed up,

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:03.840
I caused trouble for all of you...

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:07.370
Why don't we take a break?

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:09.440
You're tired too, right, Kokomi-chan?

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:10.590
Agreed.

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:18.360
I guess even you mess up sometimes, Kokomi-chan.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:19.960
I feel better now.

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:21.910
It's your first time being a waitress,

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:24.070
and you're perfect.

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:27.010
Thanks for trying to cheer me up.

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:28.840
I'm serious.

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:32.040
Come on, eat some cookies and cheer up!

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:33.750
Thanks for waiting.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:37.310
It's the Café Cosmos special blend.

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:39.120
Have some.

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:42.170
You made this?

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.720
You're silly.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:47.250
Who else would have?

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:52.510
The color looks normal.

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:55.390
Come on, guys. Trust me.

00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:57.830
It smells good.

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:02.340
This is really good!

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:05.860
It's good!

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:09.090
Coffee is what makes a café.

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:11.650
I worked hard to learn how to make it.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:15.530
So you practiced a lot.

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:18.440
I messed up lots of times, though.

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:20.760
I'm not good at cooking and the like.

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:23.200
I'm not good with ceramics, either.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:26.960
It always takes me longer to get things right.

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:31.340
You're able to make coffee 
this good now, though.

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:32.420
That's great.

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:34.310
Thank you.

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:36.080
Since I messed up so many times,

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:39.100
it makes me even happier to hear you say so.

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:41.730
It's failure that leads to success.

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:43.790
Every dilemma is a chance.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:45.520
If you fall, just get back up.

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:48.530
It feels like I'm always falling, though.

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:01.870
Why are you up this late?

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:06.400
There's something I wanted to think 
over for my tournament routine.

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:09.070
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:11.120
Both your dad and I

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:16.040
want you to have fun more than 
we want you to score high.

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:18.000
Thank you, Mom.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.920
<i>It's failure that leads to success.</i>

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:29.270
<i>Every dilemma is a chance.</i>

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:30.810
<b>Routine Plan</b>

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:32.820
<i>If you fall, just get back up.</i>

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:37.890
<i>I'd be happy if I did something 
risky and won, but...</i>

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:46.530
Marezou-san, do you think I can do it?

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:04.100
Kokomi-chan, good morning!

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:05.930
Oh, Sagara-san.

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:08.520
Good morning.

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.240
Are you headed out somewhere?

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:12.480
I have an event at the shopping district.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:14.480
I'm doing a street performance.

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:19.140
But my juggling success rate 
is still only about half.

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:21.430
I'm so nervous!

00:18:21.430 --> 00:18:23.270
Yeah, that's nerve-wracking.

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:26.050
Well, you just gotta give it your best shot.

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:29.580
You're not afraid of failing?

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:30.250
Huh?

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.390
Sure, I am.

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:36.340
I don't think there's anyone 
who isn't afraid of failing.

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:41.970
Oh, Sagara-san, I didn't 
get to say it before, but...

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:44.670
If you focus on throwing the 
balls instead of catching them,

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:46.140
you won't mess up, I think.

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:48.080
I see!

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.770
I'll try it.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:50.520
See you later!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:01.270
<b>Café Cosmos</b>

00:18:58.290 --> 00:18:59.680
Good morning.

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:01.280
Good morning, Kokomi-chan.

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:05.160
What happened with these?

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.720
You caught me.

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:12.120
I wanted to try practicing on my
own before everyone got here.

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:14.930
It's hard making a cream soda, though.

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:17.040
I'm following the recipe to the letter,

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:18.880
but it's just not going right.

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:22.470
Don't you think this one is good, though?

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:26.940
Oh. It's close.

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:28.640
It's really close to cream soda.

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:31.520
But you won't say it tastes good?

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:36.260
But still, it's amazing you were 
able to get this good so quickly.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:39.460
So I'm not there yet...

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:40.700
Too bad.

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:41.600
All right!

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:46.910
I'm going to keep practicing until 
I make a cream soda you like!

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:51.460
How can you keep working 
so hard, Sasahara-senpai?

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:53.130
Hmm...

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:55.750
It's because I really love this café, I guess.

00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:02.110
I was told I should try a new
move in the tournament.

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:04.880
I need to decide by tomorrow,

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:06.430
but I'm not sure what to do.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:10.630
I love rhythmic gymnastics, but...

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:13.840
You're scared of giving it a try?

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.360
Yes.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:21.000
Actually, I wanted to try making 
cream soda because of you.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:21.890
Huh?

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:24.740
You said my coffee was good, right?

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:29.580
I realized it when you told me I might 
be able to do it if I practiced.

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:33.710
I didn't think I'd get good immediately, of course,

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:37.090
but I knew I'd get nowhere if 
I just gave up before I started.

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:43.140
Maybe you're just convinced 
there's no way you can pull it off.

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:45.940
That might be it.

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:48.230
Is the move that difficult?

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:51.480
I'm only able to get it right 
80% of the time in practice.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:52.390
What?

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:54.600
Then you only have 20% more 
to go before it's perfect!

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:56.350
Yeah.

00:20:56.710 --> 00:20:59.110
I'm starting from zero over here!

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:04.530
You really are amazing, Sasahara-senpai.

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:08.350
I'll keep trying until I can get it.

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:11.390
You're right. I only have 20% to go, don't I?

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:14.720
Good work.

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:16.760
Sasahara-senpai...

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:19.180
Do it the way you want to.

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:20.680
That's the best thing.

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:21.600
Yeah.

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:22.910
All right...

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:26.050
Let's have a toast to you 
getting out of your slump

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:28.270
with some cream soda.

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:30.050
Cheers!

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:33.960
Hey, Kokomi-chan.

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:35.690
That's the one I messed up on.

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:38.400
Kokomi-chan, you're so silly...

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:43.570
Good morning!

00:21:43.830 --> 00:21:47.160
What's this? You guys sure are 
in high spirits this morning.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.120
Did something funny happen?

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.250
It's our secret.

00:21:52.250 --> 00:21:53.080
Right.

00:21:57.470 --> 00:21:58.620
Sensei,

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:01.320
about what you suggested the other day...

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:02.500
You thought it over?

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:04.630
I did!

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:10.600
<i>We will now begin the Fall National 
High School All-Sports Tournament</i>

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:14.360
<i>girls' singles event in rhythmic gymnastics.</i>

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:20.900
<b>You can do it, Kokomi Shiina!</b>

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:20.900
<i>Seiou Academy High School
second-year, Kokomi Shiina-san!</i>

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:22.360
Ready!

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:28.860
You can do it!

00:22:30.380 --> 00:22:32.460
<i>I don't want to regret anything,</i>

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:36.540
<i>so I'm going to try to become 
a new me, a new Kokomi Shiina!</i>

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:25.010
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:12.480 --> 00:24:14.150
Neuron!

00:24:14.150 --> 00:24:14.720
Cream!

00:24:14.720 --> 00:24:15.280
Cream!

00:24:15.280 --> 00:24:15.840
Cream!

00:24:15.840 --> 00:24:16.520
Cream!

00:24:16.520 --> 00:24:17.760
Soft!

00:24:18.170 --> 00:24:19.470
The next song...

00:24:19.470 --> 00:24:22.940
I mean, next episode, is Evolutionary Girl!

00:24:19.750 --> 00:24:25.010
<b>Episode 9: Evolutionary Girl</b>
